{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8d3c03d0-7e15-8b2f-ad21-4b44d80a63c9",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T13:45:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Adriana Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:42:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:42:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Anita. So, I'm calling for my mother, because apparently I'm the one who makes the phone calls in this family. She wants to widen her driveway, and I think that's a curb cut. Is that the right term?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, if the driveway opening at the curb is changing, that's a curb cut. Is she adding a new opening or making an existing one wider?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:42:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Making the existing one wider, I think. Um, about a car's width more. Does that change anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:42:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can. Widening an existing one is usually handled as a modification, but it still goes through approval. Is the street a city street, as far as you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:42:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I believe so. It's not a state road or anything. At least there's no sign saying so, and I didn't go looking for one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:42:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, we can confirm it when you apply. What are you trying to find out today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:43:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two things, mainly. Who do we hire to do the work, and who actually approves it? Like, do we hire somebody first or ask permission first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:43:14-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Permission first. The work is done by a licensed paving or excavation contractor, and the contractor usually pulls the permit for the owner. The approval itself runs through the city, with Public Services involved because the curb and sidewalk are in the public right of way. Zoning looks at how wide the driveway can be on the lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:43:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so two offices. Of course. And the contractor, it can be any paving company?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:43:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It needs to be one that's licensed and insured to work in the right of way. I can't recommend a specific company, but any reputable one will know the process."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:43:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And the fee? Is there a fee for the permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:43:54-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's an application fee. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and it can depend on the scope. The permit office can quote it when you submit the application. Do you want me to transfer you, or I can take your number and have someone call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:44:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, sorry. [pause] The school nurse is calling me on the other line. She said my son has a mild cough and wants to know if I'm picking him up. I'll call her back in a minute. Sorry, where were we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:44:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. I was asking whether you'd like a transfer or a callback about the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:44:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Callback is better, I guess. Then I can deal with the nurse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:44:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's your name and the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:44:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Adriana Figueroa. It's 401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:44:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. Adriana Figueroa, 401-555-0190. And I'll note it's for your mother's driveway, widening an existing curb cut."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:44:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Should I have a measurement ready, or a drawing, or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a simple sketch with the current width and the new width helps, and the location on the lot. Your contractor can provide that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. I can do a sketch. Might be a very bad sketch, but I can do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:45:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Someone will call you back, probably by tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:45:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thanks, Anita. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:45:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
